{"title":"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the largest positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which there is a unique integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/b/a3b8a8a3f034c7918a7c2cf899f052d3c3a29bd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{15} &lt; \\frac{n}{n + k} &lt; \\frac{7}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"142\" height=\"40\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying out all of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Denominator\" title=\"Denominator\">denominators</a>, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/0119e59e2ab7f0e2785b569671da8fe70205fb77.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}104(n+k) &amp;&lt; 195n&lt; 105(n+k)\\\\ 0 &amp;&lt; 91n - 104k &lt; n + k\\end{align*}\" width=\"263\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/a/8caa52f505d5f4e537f425d1395b6fd3a9d64eb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$91n - 104k &lt; n + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"155\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/8/b2828c2c217394d34f73d2ec7f59713aa012bc79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k &gt; \\frac{6}{7}n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98b97889c52418104706dfb5808b996ef372e7b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; 91n - 104k$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"121\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/7/ae7570a32b8cf58709c9ef61c5aea7f98be75448.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k &lt; \\frac{7n}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"60\" height=\"38\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9bf3b1504dd6ea52a421b7081ebf46af115bc92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48n &lt; 56k &lt; 49n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"134\" height=\"13\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is unique if it is within a maximum <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Range\" title=\"Range\">range</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/3/dd3907e89ce5b06f13d78589b5d92624a8b41a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$112$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/5/6252e3cc4a955cd438e7914bb4ebcce51f7d24ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\boxed{112}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"76\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Flip all of the fractions for\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/bef75a0b9482dd0efc4ff0cb17d912353663dc8f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{ccccc}\\frac{15}{8} &amp;&gt;&amp; \\frac{k + n}{n} &amp;&gt;&amp; \\frac{13}{7}\\\\  105n &amp;&gt;&amp; 56 (k + n)&amp; &gt;&amp; 104n\\\\  49n &amp;&gt;&amp; 56k&amp; &gt;&amp; 48n\\end{array}\\]\" width=\"244\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p>Continue as in Solution 1.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Flip the fractions and subtract one from all sides to yield <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f41b60503cc047170384ab0c8c6beaa2b5d445bc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{7}{8}&gt;\\frac{k}{n}&gt;\\frac{6}{7}.\\]\" width=\"91\" height=\"37\" />  Multiply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5adadfc57d5ef163181e6cc7900ab474129e7c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56n$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/d/e6d8522ade54297b4b99cdf736df90358fcb5bac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[49n&gt;56k&gt;48n.\\]\" width=\"138\" height=\"13\" /> This is equivalent to find the largest value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that there is only one multiple of 56 within the open interval between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df91a030e8cc8e9da728c1d61a3ab9955b69183.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/8/ca89250e02c914e90d9f27477806086e73168b2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/e/a9eecc1414a85d89bc18a7e5c6ab90a3fe3c4d10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=112,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"17\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/f/25f138e88d2d7172b3ab9024c947be9bcf162e7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$98&gt;k&gt;96$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"94\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/232ac0350286740a22acfbb19b334a03c25532c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=97$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> is the unique value. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/3/513fc9c64e2806e484aa35a55c02fc621cd5016e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\geq 113,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"16\" /> there is at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ed5b97753a47f60fcfc152eec3b0cf4ffe7c0fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(49\\cdot 113-48\\cdot 113)-1=112$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"235\" height=\"18\" /> possible numbers for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and there is one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> every 56 numbers. Hence, there must be at least two values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> that work.  So, the largest value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110495c19cff553380cfdaf8a094c31134e27052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{112}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that in order for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> to be unique, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/6/df66ebc24ed505c3dec7b20d7d0873d5a2f46983.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{n + k+ 1} \\le \\frac{8}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"123\" height=\"39\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/3/853c192589e92dcf767d181871527328a1a36722.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{n+ k-1} \\ge \\frac{7}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"123\" height=\"38\" /> must be true. Solving these inequalities for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/2/9e2fd1244091ed298f237b4f3a0c28db713a7c7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{6}(k-1) \\le n \\le \\frac{8}{7}(k+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"195\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, we want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4bc516d726cc36d498dba28c3c0742a4800d736.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{6}(k-1)\\le \\frac{8}{7}(k+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"159\" height=\"37\" />. Solving this inequality yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/a/34a1799c613d84cf6159dc39a92e85d06cdda0d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\le 97$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />, and plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/6/a867155714bca73620b5b111b6ec292e1fc4acf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{n+k} &lt; \\frac{7}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"95\" height=\"40\" /> in the original equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/9/7c9410301133cf560725496cb737616b2c68a57e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le 112$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110495c19cff553380cfdaf8a094c31134e27052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{112}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME\" title=\"1987 AIME\">1987 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016230034\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 284/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7500/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.067      1 -total\n 63.42%    8.922      1 Template:AIME_box\n 35.00%    4.923      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2825:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016230034 and revision id 240132. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}